<Legal title="Terms of Use" path="/terms/" description="The rules for using myboutiki.">
<p>By using myboutiki you agree to these terms.</p>
<h2>Your account</h2><p>Give accurate details and keep your password safe. You are responsible for what you post and send from your account. One person may run up to 10 shops.</p>
<h2>Selling and buying</h2><p>myboutiki is a place where shops show items and buyers contact them. Orders, payment for items and delivery are arranged directly between buyer and seller (for example on WhatsApp). myboutiki is not a party to those sales and does not guarantee items, but we act on reports of fraud.</p>
<h2>What is not allowed</h2><ul><li>Illegal, stolen, counterfeit or dangerous items, weapons, drugs, adult content, or anything banned in your country.</li><li>Misleading listings, spam, harassment or impersonation.</li><li>Using someone else's photos or brand without permission.</li></ul>
<p>We may remove content or suspend accounts that break these rules.</p>
<h2>Paid features</h2><p>Boosts and the verified badge are paid in advance for the period shown. Verified badges require a valid ID check. Payments are non-refundable once the feature has started, unless required by law.</p>
<h2>Changes</h2><p>We may update these terms; continuing to use myboutiki means you accept the updated terms.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2><p><a href="mailto:support@myboutiki.com">support@myboutiki.com</a></p>
<div class="ar"><h2>شروط الاستخدام</h2><p>باستخدامك ماي بوتيكي توافق على: تقديم معلومات صحيحة، وعدم بيع منتجات ممنوعة أو مقلدة أو مسروقة، وعدم التضليل أو الإزعاج. الطلب والدفع والتوصيل يتم مباشرة بين البائع والمشتري. يحق لنا حذف المحتوى أو إيقاف الحسابات المخالفة. الميزات المدفوعة (الترويج والتوثيق) غير قابلة للاسترداد بعد بدئها.</p></div>
